{"id":"n15931-1-7","stage":1,"title":"매주 · 每周","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15931-1-7-1","ko":"새로 들어간 직장은 어떠니?","zh":"新工作的情况怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어간","meaning":"进入，转入","explanation":"들어가다：进入，转入；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"3","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직장은","meaning":"工作单位，职场","explanation":"직장：工作单位，职场；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"직장","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58297","senseId":"1","lemma":"직장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떠니?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进入，转入","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"开始新的状态或时期。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"fdfb4ffae29b3def","term":"직장","zh":"工作单位，职场","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3","entryId":"58297","definition":"指收取报酬而上班的地方。","pronunciation":["직짱"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/91b02e78f96b8066ab08.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15931-1-7-2","ko":"매주 야근을 해서 몸이 힘들어.","zh":"因为每周都要加班，身体很累。","note":"点不懂的词，