40f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"有花费很多力气的一面。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8c54f09c7a665944ae60.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.898,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15931","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":34,"sequenceScore":1.5514,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["新工作的情况怎么样？","因为每周都要加班，身体很累。","你的爱好是什么？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["新工作的情况怎么样？","因为每周都要加班，身体很累。","你的爱好是什么？"],"answer":1}]}
